title: 'pallet-child-bounties: allow forced cleanup after parent deactivation'
doc:
  - audience: [Runtime Dev, Runtime User]
    description: |
      Allow `RejectOrigin` to close a child bounty after its parent bounty has
      left the active state, as documented by the pallet. Signed callers still
      require the parent bounty to be active and the caller to be its curator.
      No storage migration is required.
crates:
  - name: pallet-child-bounties
    bump: patch
